{"voice": "am_michael", "speed": 1.08, "lines": [{"id": "L01", "text": "One second he was diving for lobster. The next, everything went black.", "pause_after": 0.3, "shot": "S01", "emphasis": ["lobster", "black"]}, {"id": "L02", "text": "Cape Cod, June 2021.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S02", "emphasis": ["Cape", "Cod"]}, {"id": "L03", "text": "Lobster diver Michael Packard was forty-five feet down.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S03", "emphasis": ["Michael", "Packard", "forty-five"]}, {"id": "L04", "text": "His first thought: a shark.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S04", "emphasis": ["shark"]}, {"id": "L05", "text": "But there were no teeth. No pain.", "pause_after": 0.3, "shot": "S05", "emphasis": ["no", "teeth"]}, {"id": "L06", "text": "He was inside a whale's mouth.", "pause_after": 0.35, "shot": "S06", "emphasis": ["whale's", "mouth"]}, {"id": "L07", "text": "Experts think a feeding humpback scooped him up by accident.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S07", "emphasis": ["humpback", "accident"]}, {"id": "L08", "text": "He still had his scuba tank, so he kept breathing.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S08", "emphasis": ["kept", "breathing"]}, {"id": "L09", "text": "He thought he was going to die. He thought of his sons.", "pause_after": 0.45, "shot": "S09", "emphasis": ["die", "sons"]}, {"id": "L10", "text": "But a humpback can't actually swallow a person.", "pause_after": 0.15, "shot": "S10", "emphasis": ["can't", "swallow"]}, {"id": "L11", "text": "Its throat is far too narrow.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S11", "emphasis": ["too", "narrow"]}, {"id": "L12", "text": "After thirty to forty seconds, by his own estimate,", "pause_after": 0.05, "shot": "S12", "emphasis": ["thirty", "forty", "seconds"]}, {"id": "L13", "text": "he saw light. The whale surfaced and threw its head side to side,", "pause_after": 0.05, "shot": "S13", "emphasis": ["light", "surfaced"]}, {"id": "L14", "text": "and spat him out.", "pause_after": 0.35, "shot": "S14", "emphasis": ["spat"]}, {"id": "L15", "text": "His crewmate, Josiah Mayo, pulled him from the water.", "pause_after": 0.2, "shot": "S15", "emphasis": ["Josiah", "Mayo"]}, {"id": "L16", "text": "Bruised, sore, and no broken bones.", "pause_after": 0.3, "shot": "S16", "emphasis": ["no", "broken", "bones"]}, {"id": "L17", "text": "A humpback can't swallow you. But it can still close its mouth around you.", "pause_after": 0.0, "shot": "S17", "emphasis": ["close", "around", "you"]}]}